{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md","title":"Fixed-Point Existence and Uniqueness","display":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed-Point Existence and Uniqueness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-characterization","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-characterization"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed-Point Existence and Uniqueness","depends_on":["[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed-Point Existence and Uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a74a9caa29e2a312\" href=\"?note=a74a9caa29e2a312\" title=\"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem\">89-thm-fixed-point-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03089c3cefed4872\" href=\"?note=03089c3cefed4872\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness\">89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为弱不动点集合，在当前模态化域上与加强版本相容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n((B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n((B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>有效不动点定理给非空；独立的 Bernardi 唯一性证明给任意两成员的 GL 等价。唯一的是可证等价类，不是原始公式的语法代表。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 表示这两项时，它们才构成 De Jongh–Sambin 性质的成立证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n((B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DJ}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false}],"bytes":1264,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["a74a9caa29e2a312","03089c3cefed4872","02536e2efd437c59"]}